# Every text file is stored in the index and checked out with LF, whatever the
# platform. Git's own detection decides what counts as text; the entries below
# pin the binaries it must not touch, including the extensionless keystores.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png        binary
*.jar        binary
*.p12        binary
*.pkcs12     binary
*.keystore   binary
*.truststore binary
**/keystore  binary
